WEBVTT

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:05.640
Present Day

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:08.590
Present Time

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:23.340
And you don't seem to understand

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:28.540
A shame you seemed an honest man

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:33.290
And all the fears you hold so dear

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:38.560
Will turn to whisper in your ear

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:41.960
And you know what they say might hurt you

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:44.430
And you know that it means so much

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:49.190
And you don't even feel a thing

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:54.850
I am falling, I am fading

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:58.970
I have lost it all

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:26.990
I am falling, I am fading, I am drowning

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:29.630
Help me to breathe

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:34.840
I am hurting, I have lost it all

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:37.380
I am losing

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:41.580
Help me to breathe

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:11.630
What are you scared of?

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:14.890
Just try it for a little bit.

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:41.240
Cyberia?

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:44.240
I don't come here because I want to.

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:10.260
10,000 yen?! What a ripoff!

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:14.140
The going price is only around 4000!

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:22.440
We call it Accela.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:24.990
It's not exactly a drug.

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:28.910
but you have to jump through the same kinds of hoops to get it.

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:24.340
I feel...

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:26.260
accelerated.

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:17.430
Hurry up, come to me.

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:25.050
No, that's not it.

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:31.780
I don't have any mail...

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.990
I don't get it...

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:40.770
Oh.

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:45.700
I thought somebody was here.

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:48.610
Who?

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:54.410
Your imaginary friend.

00:05:56.950 --> 00:05:59.140
Or something like that.

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:07.260
You're gonna be late again.

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:16.990
Lain!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.200
Good morning.

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:25.210
Good morning.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.440
See what I mean? It couldn't have been her.

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:30.910
You think so? But...

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:34.410
What?

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:40.480
Cut it out. I feel sorry for her.

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:44.450
It's nothing. Come on, let's go.

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:46.030
Okay.

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:47.290
But...

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:48.900
Oh, let it go.

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:56.100
Have you gotten any more e-mail?

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:57.820
E-mail?

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:01.500
From Chisa.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:05.550
Oh, that. No, I haven't gotten any more.

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:08.250
You got that prank mail, too, Lain?

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.450
What?

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:10.580
Really?

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:15.340
I was just curious.

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:17.220
Huh?

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:20.060
You know, maybe she does look a little like her...

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:23.790
Lain, what were you doing last night?

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:26.160
Yeah, yeah!

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:28.100
Come on, I'm telling you it wasn't her!

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.430
I guess not. She doesn't look like her at all.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.400
What?

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:41.120
There was a girl at Cyberia last night who looked just like you, Lain.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.620
Cyberia?

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:49.120
We finally worked up the nerve to go there last night.

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:51.630
Come on, it wasn't such a big deal.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:54.390
Yeah, right, you were the one who was all nervous!

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:59.630
Oh. It's a club. Young people go there at night.

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:06.240
There was a girl there who looked a little like you, Lain.

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:09.520
Last night, I...

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:12.980
We know. It wasn't you.

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:15.350
We didn't get a good look at her,

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:19.950
but she had on these wild clothes, and chewed people out left and right.

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:24.150
Yeah, it was like she was your total opposite.

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:26.950
But she did look like her...

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:31.090
Hey, I know! Let's take her with us next time!

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:33.500
You want to make sure, huh?

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:36.000
Cut it out! You're just making fun of her.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:42.010
I bet when a girl like Lain goes to a club, her personality does a 180!

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:46.780
Oh. Maybe Lain would liven up a bit.

00:09:46.780 --> 00:09:49.520
Right! Let's go, Lain!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:52.090
It might be fun.

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:56.690
You'd have more fun if you were a little more sociable, Lain.

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.520
Right, Lain?

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:04.800
Accela, a type of smart supplement,

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:09.790
uses nano-mechanisms to oscillate at a specific frequency within the body,

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:13.700
triggering the secretion of a specific hormone.

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:19.650
It is said that when secreted, this hormone affects the time-sense

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:24.520
of the human mind, making it seem as if one's awareness is accelerated.

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:30.390
Not only the consciousness, but the workings of the brain itself are altered,

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:35.390
multiplying the brain's operational capacity by 2 to 12 times.

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:42.500
The nano-mechanism itself is destroyed by digestive juices within 24 hours,

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:45.400
but it is unknown how long its effectiveness...

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:05.820
Let's have fun at Cyberia tonight! From, Arisu

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:23.010
I'll pass on tonight.

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:31.520
Everyone is connected.

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:07.480
Is this your place?

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:12.620
Great! I have a delivery for you.

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:15.520
I'll start unloading it. Could you get the gate for me?

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.280
Could you sign this, please?

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:37.880
This thing is so cool!

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:40.410
I wish I had one of these...

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:41.540
Thanks.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:45.080
All this is yours?

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:47.820
I'm not sure.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:50.720
Then you don't know what this is?

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:55.200
It's a top of the line Navi!

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:56.890
Fully loaded, too!

00:13:57.260 --> 00:14:00.330
With this kind of horsepower, you can move around freely

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:03.650
without any stress at all, even in the Wired.

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:09.360
I use a home-brew system, myself. It doesn't hold a candle to this.

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:14.750
No, it's not like that. I don't know anything about it, either.

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:17.700
You will soon enough.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:19.580
Have a good one.

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:01.870
Your Navi came, right?

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:06.720
Get that mess cleaned up soon, all right? It's in the way.

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:10.800
I'll set it up for you after dinner.

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:15.170
This Navi's good enough that I'd want to take it for a spin.

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:16.940
Dad...

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:22.710
I want you to set it up now.

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:26.350
Hey, why are you in such a hurry?

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:32.020
Lain...

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:34.820
I'll do it.

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:42.330
You can't keep using that children's Navi forever.

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:47.340
For communication, you need a powerful system

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:52.340
that will mature alongside your relationships with people.

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:54.670
Understand, Lain?

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:07.680
Come here.

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:14.190
Register yourself as the machine's user.

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:22.370
Try talking to it.

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:25.200
Hello, Navi.

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:32.620
Now this Navi's yours, Lain.

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:35.080
You can show off to your friends now.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.350
Oops.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:45.800
Hey, Mika. Something wrong?

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:57.540
Navi, do I have mail?

00:16:57.540 --> 00:16:59.840
Lain has no mail.

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:22.280
Lain, where are you? Everybody's waiting! You have to come!

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:34.960
Why won't you come?

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:41.910
Okay, turn left at that corner!

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:44.820
Then go straight ahead.

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:47.240
See it?

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:49.660
Yeah.

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:51.820
We're in the basement! Got it?

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:04.280
Hey! You!

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:05.870
You're blocking the stairs.

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.340
Sorry.

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:10.620
If you do it that way,

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:13.520
you'll get spotted by the Info-Guard Center right off the bat!

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:15.610
What's the big deal? I'd just be attacking it.

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:19.090
Hey, next time we go over to that game center, let's...

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.200
What took you so long, Lain?

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.970
You're usually in bed now, aren't you, Lain?

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:35.590
Lain, don't you have anything better to wear out at night?

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:42.010
We'll pick out something a little more grown-up for you next time, Lain.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.620
You think she'd look good in grown-up clothes?

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:45.680
Reika!

00:18:46.150 --> 00:18:47.450
Hey...

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:48.320
What?

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:52.160
I guess the girl we saw really wasn't Lain.

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:55.460
That's what I've been telling you!

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:59.370
Lain doesn't dress like that or talk like that.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:01.270
She doesn't look like that, either.

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:05.860
Did she really look like me?

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:09.780
Yeah! I was positive it was you!

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:12.210
Oh.

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:19.640
What the...?!

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:22.040
He's got a gun!

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:28.660
Help me!

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:32.060
Juri!

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:03.380
Lain!

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:08.160
What's she doing?

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:09.670
Reika, take care of Juri.

00:20:09.670 --> 00:20:10.760
Arisu?

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:12.350
Arisu!

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:19.180
What're you looking at?

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:24.180
Lain, what're you doing? Let's get out of here! Hurry!

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:25.530
Lain!

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:28.160
Lain!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.280
Lain!

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:32.280
Go away!

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:44.560
Why are you making me do this?!

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:47.760
What right do you have?!

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:51.470
I just wanted to clear my head, that's all!

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:54.470
I don't know anything about it! Leave me out of it!

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:57.280
You're that scattered god's...

00:20:57.280 --> 00:21:00.050
I don't want anything to do with it! Nothing!

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:03.790
The Wired can't be allowed to interfere with the real world!

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.400
I don't want anything to do with it!

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:08.130
Who the hell are you?!

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:10.200
L-Lain...

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:17.900
I don't want anything to do with it... Don't want anything to do with it...

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:21.630
Don't want... I don't want... Don't want anything to do with it...

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:22.980
Don't want anything to...

00:21:22.980 --> 00:21:25.050
Don't want...

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:26.170
Don't want anything...

00:21:26.170 --> 00:21:27.910
Don't want anything to do with it...

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:30.580
Don't want... Don't want anything to do with it...

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:32.310
I don't want...

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:34.640
No matter where you go,

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:38.090
everyone's connected.

00:22:28.900 --> 00:22:33.330
nan no tsumi mo nai hazu na no ni

00:22:28.900 --> 00:22:33.330
Although I must be innocent,

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:37.240
nanraka no batsu wo uketeru

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:37.240
now I am punished.

00:22:37.670 --> 00:22:43.540
jibun de maita tane de mo nai no ni

00:22:37.670 --> 00:22:43.540
I wasn't the one who sowed those seeds, but nevertheless

00:22:44.260 --> 00:22:50.450
sakimidareta hana tsumasareru

00:22:44.260 --> 00:22:50.450
I have to pull up the flowers that bloomed from them.

00:22:57.000 --> 00:23:01.640
shiranai koto to mo ienai ga

00:22:57.000 --> 00:23:01.640
I can't say I didn't know about it,

00:23:01.640 --> 00:23:06.090
katabou katsuida oboe wa nai

00:23:01.640 --> 00:23:06.090
but I don't remember taking any part in it.

00:23:06.090 --> 00:23:12.280
jiyuu wo takaku kawasareta ki mo suru ga

00:23:06.090 --> 00:23:12.280
I think my freedom cost me dearly,

00:23:12.810 --> 00:23:19.520
kokoro made yasuku utta oboe wa nai

00:23:12.810 --> 00:23:19.520
but I don't remember selling my soul so cheaply.

00:23:19.880 --> 00:23:27.570
Hey Hey kutabatte osaraba suru made

00:23:19.880 --> 00:23:27.570
Hey hey, until I die and say farewell...

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:37.480
Hey Hey dare no te ni mo kakaranai

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:37.480
Hey hey... no one can touch me.

00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:43.090
tooi yoru wo urotsuiteiru

00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:43.090
You probably don't know

00:23:43.090 --> 00:23:50.800
shiranai darou eien no narazu monotachi wo

00:23:43.090 --> 00:23:50.800
the eternal outlaws prowling in the distant night.
